The '''Sky Pillar''' can be reached by ship once the player has met with both [[Ruby Chamber|Groudon]] and [[Sapphire Cave|Kyogre]] and has spoken to the elderly man in [[Kin Island]]. From there, a new option in the harbour will be available for the player.

To progress up the tower, the player must walk over several patterns of broken tiles. If stopped on a broken tile, you will fall down a floor.

